block_cycles is set EXPLICITLY (§7.3): 0 is rejected by lfs_init, and -1 would
disable block-level wear levelling, which is claim L-6 against EMMC-HW-01's
30,000 P/E budget.  500 is mid-range of upstream's suggested 100–1000.

